sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant W as Inquiry widget
    participant E as TYPO3 eID<br/>a2ui_generate
    participant A as Agent (nr-llm)
    V->>W: describes need in one sentence
    W->>E: POST intent
    E->>A: system prompt + component catalog
    A-->>E: surface JSON (components + data model)
    E-->>W: validated A2UI surface
    W->>W: render native form from JSON
    V->>W: fills fields, submits
    W->>E: POST a2ui_submit (data model)
    E-->>V: stored inquiry + confirmation
